{
  "score_support": "supports_wrong_score",
  "score_support_basis": "CoT理由认为评论精确指出了具体部分(三种encoding)并说明了问题(缺乏详细分析)，因此给出5分。但实际上虽然提到了具体编码方式，但未指向论文中的具体section/table/figure，且'由于页数限制'是常见的泛泛说法，真正的标签是3分（无法确定具体部分，但说明了需要什么）。",
  "error_sentences": [
    {
      "sentence": "The comment explicitly mentions specific components of the work: \"Node-centric encoding, Labeled-edge encoding and Opinion-tuple encoding,\" which are essential design aspects of SSA. This allows the authors to accurately identify the parts of the paper that are being addressed (likely the sections or discussions where these encodings are described).",
      "error_type": "evidence_misread",
      "explanation": "评论仅用模糊的'由于页数限制'概括，没有指向具体的section/table/figure或唯一可识别部分，CoT用'likely'一词本身就说明无法准确确定论文中的具体位置。"
    },
    {
      "sentence": "The comment also clearly specifies the issue: the lack of detailed analysis due to page limitations. Therefore, it is fully grounded and specific, meeting the criteria for a score of 5.",
      "error_type": "score_mapping_error",
      "explanation": "根据评分标准，分数5需要'明确提到论文的哪个部分'且'评论应明显'让作者知道指哪个部分。本评论因页数限制而泛泛提及三种编码方式，作者无法精确定位到具体section/table/figure，应属分数3-4档，而非5分。"
    }
  ],
  "overall_basis": "CoT推理理由高估了评论的grounding程度，将泛泛的'缺乏详细分析'误判为精确指明了具体部分，导致分数从正确的3分偏高至5分。"
}
